  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 425 F. Line a rimmed 18 x 13 inch sheet pan with parchment.",
    "In a large bowl, toss the broccoli with 2 tbsp olive oil, 1/2 tsp salt, and the pepper. Spread it on the pan in a single layer, leaving room in the center.",
    "Roast the broccoli for 6 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, stir the remaining 1 tbsp olive oil, lemon zest, lemon juice, garlic, maple syrup, paprika, and remaining 1/4 tsp salt in a small bowl.",
    "Pat the salmon dry. Push the broccoli to the sides and set the fillets in the center of the pan.",
    "Spoon the lemon mixture over the salmon.",
    "Roast 8 minutes more, until the salmon reaches 145 F in the thickest part and flakes easily, and the broccoli edges are lightly browned.",
    "Serve the salmon with the broccoli and spoon any pan juices over the top."
